Python, Flask, and APIs each have different jobs, but they work together to make your website function.

1. What is each thing?
File:Python logo 01.svg - Wikimedia Commons

Python — The language

Python is the programming language you're writing your instructions in. It handles logic, variables, functions, loops, and data.

Flask Logo PNG Vector (SVG) Free Download

Flask — The web framework

Flask is a Python tool that helps you build websites. It receives browser requests, decides what code to run, and sends back HTML pages.

