API — The communication system

An API lets your program communicate with another service. Your app uses the Art Institute's API to retrieve artwork information.

Think of it this way:

Python = The language you speak.

Flask = The restaurant employee taking your order and coordinating everything.

API = The supplier that provides the ingredients (artwork information).

