3. What does each file actually do?
File

Responsibility

home.html

Displays the search form

app.py

Connects the pages, receives input, and calls functions

api.py

Communicates with the Art Institute API

results.html

Displays the returned artwork information

The important thing to understand is that Flask doesn't replace Python. Flask is a framework that uses Python. And the API doesn't build your website; it simply provides the data your website needs.

